  1161	    def deployment_mode_validate(self, *, bind_host: str | None = None) -> None:
  1162	        """Fail-closed startup gate for ``deployment_mode=multi_user`` (FR-4).
  1163	
  1164	        **Full 4-condition suite** (Phase 4 ACT-402 completes the P1 stub,
  1165	        which evaluated only (a)-(c)) — see Phase 4 AC-3.
  1166	
  1167	        No-op when :meth:`deployment_mode` resolves to ``"single_user"`` (the
  1168	        default) — this gate only ever constrains ``multi_user`` deployments,
  1169	        so it can never regress single-user/LAN behaviour.
  1170	
  1171	        Conditions checked (multi_user only)
  1172	        -------------------------------------
  1173	        (a) ``auth.provider`` must not be ``"none"``.
  1174	        (b) ``auth.rbac_enforcement`` must resolve to enforced
  1175	            (:meth:`resolve_rbac_enforced`).
