codex
One structural break is already clear: `create_app()` is explicitly public and mountable, but it only validates the configured `viewer.bind_host`; it has no visibility into the host a process manager actually binds. I’m now checking whether repository launch artifacts constrain that gap and whether the MCP’s packaged stdio topology materially limits the second finding.
