   698	            ``"0.0.0.0"``).  Used only for the fail-closed
   699	            ``disabled``-on-non-loopback gate.
   700	
   701	        Returns
   702	        -------
   703	        bool
   704	            ``True``  — ``require_role`` enforces role checks on every request.
   705	            ``False`` — ``require_role`` passes through unconditionally.
   706	
   707	        Raises
   708	        ------
   709	        ValueError
