   787	    def resolve_workspace_isolation_enforced(self, provider: str, bind_host: str) -> bool:
   788	        """Resolve whether workspace row-level isolation is actively enforced.
   789	
   790	        This is called **once** at app-create time and the result is stored
   791	        on ``app.state.workspace_isolation_enforced``. Every subsequent query
   792	        in the catalog, builder, and agent-job services reads that flag
