  1167	    **Never returns secret material** — every condition ``detail`` only
  1168	    ever names config keys, resolved booleans, or file paths (identical to
  1169	    the text ``deployment_mode_validate`` raises with).
  1170	
  1171	    Access: owner / admin only.
  1172	    """
  1173	    return config.deployment_mode_status()
