   973	    the workspace; :func:`token_service.issue_user_pat` enforces this and
   974	    independently re-checks it at every resolution (a later role downgrade
   975	    for the target user invalidates the PAT's elevated privilege
   976	    immediately, no restart required).
   977	
   978	    **``plaintext`` in the response is shown here ONLY.**
   979	
   980	    422 when ``user_id`` is omitted AND there is no caller identity (no
   981	    "self" to default to in single-operator/no-auth mode — the caller must
   982	    say who the PAT is for).
   983	    """
