  1160	    helper) — this endpoint NEVER raises the way the startup gate does, so
  1161	    an operator can inspect why a multi_user deployment would refuse to
  1162	    start without taking the server down.
  1163	
  1164	    ``conditions`` is an empty list when ``deployment_mode=single_user``
  1165	    (the gate is a no-op outside multi_user).
  1166	
  1167	    **Never returns secret material** — every condition ``detail`` only
  1168	    ever names config keys, resolved booleans, or file paths (identical to
  1169	    the text ``deployment_mode_validate`` raises with).
  1170	
  1171	    Access: owner / admin only.
