   532	    discovery: under ``catalog_only`` no provider is ever called (an empty
   533	    or denied catalog result is terminal); under ``catalog_then_discovery``
   534	    only the plan's residual question IDs generate a provider request --
   535	    covered questions are never re-queried and their selection is never
   536	    mutated by the discovery merge.
