   217	    # --- Middleware (outermost → innermost: CORS → allowlist → auth → rate-limit) ---
   218	    #
   219	    # Starlette/FastAPI middleware is processed in *reverse* insertion order at
   220	    # runtime (last added = outermost).  We add them innermost-first so the
   221	    # final execution order matches the documented stack.
   222	    #
   223	    # 0. Rate limit (innermost — added first, runs AFTER auth sets identity)
   224	    #
   225	    # P5.6: per-identity + per-route sliding-window rate limiter.  Keyed on
   226	    # (user_id, route) so one user's burst cannot throttle another.  Auth must
