   686	    direct read of the run's claim ledger when only ``(source_run_id,
   687	    claim_id)`` is known. Uses the max-permissive threshold internally — this
   688	    is an existence/status check for link bookkeeping, not a read-time
   689	    redaction decision (that happens at export/verify time).
